@bybit-host = https://api.bybit.com
@api-key = YOUR_BYBIT_API_KEY
@api-secret = YOUR_BYBIT_API_SECRET
@timestamp = {{$timestamp}}
@recv-window = 60000
@limit = 50
@start-time = 0
@signature = YOUR_BYBIT_SIGNATURE

# Replace @api-key, @api-secret, and @signature before sending.
# Sign the exact query string in alphabetical order:
# GET /v5/asset/transfer/query-universal-transfer-list
# query: limit={{limit}}&startTime={{start-time}}
# payload: {{timestamp}}{{api-key}}{{recv-window}}limit={{limit}}&startTime={{start-time}}
# signature: HMAC-SHA256(payload, api-secret), lowercase hexadecimal

### Main Funding -> subaccount Funding or Unified
GET {{bybit-host}}/v5/asset/transfer/query-universal-transfer-list?limit={{limit}}&startTime={{start-time}}
X-BAPI-API-KEY: {{api-key}}
X-BAPI-SIGN: {{signature}}
X-BAPI-SIGN-TYPE: 2
X-BAPI-TIMESTAMP: {{timestamp}}
X-BAPI-RECV-WINDOW: {{recv-window}}

### Same-UID Funding <-> Unified transfers
GET {{bybit-host}}/v5/asset/transfer/query-inter-transfer-list?limit={{limit}}&startTime={{start-time}}
X-BAPI-API-KEY: {{api-key}}
X-BAPI-SIGN: {{signature}}
X-BAPI-SIGN-TYPE: 2
X-BAPI-TIMESTAMP: {{timestamp}}
X-BAPI-RECV-WINDOW: {{recv-window}}
